Fenn: No, there's a buncha people in the [color="blue"]Great Hall[/color]. There's this super cool lady-
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Winston", "left")
???: [font_size=70]Nay matter![/font_size] [shake level=7 rate=30]I shalt crush thee myself![/shake]
Fenn: You talk weird.
???: Um- [wait=0.2]stayeth right there![wait=0.2] Not another step!
