Fenn: [font_size=60][wave freq=7 amp=25]I will defeat you and free this palace![/wave][/font_size]
Wizard: Oh my...
Wizard: Well, [wait=0.2]you see, [wait=0.2]I doth not much timeth for this.
Wizard: Like, [wait=0.2]I would [shake level=7 rate=10]love[/shake] to destroyeth thee,[wait=0.2] but I must findeth this [color="blue"]Workshop[/color].
Fenn: Huh? What [color="blue"]Workshop[/color]? 
